        "collapsible_tab_aCyR9r": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials and Standards",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>100% cotton, chosen for softness, breathability and everyday durability.<br/><br/>We pay attention to more than fibre composition. Our fabrics, dyes and finishing processes are selected against stringent quality and chemical-safety requirements (REACH standards), so what sits against the skin is considered as carefully as how the piece looks.<br/><br/>Made for frequent wear, regular washing and a long life in the wardrobe.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_6KXWXr": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Easy Care Instructions",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>These pieces are designed for repeated wear and frequent washing.<br/><br/>Pre-treat stains when needed. Gentle machine wash with similar colours using a mild detergent. Do not bleach. Tumble dry as permitted by the garment care label, or dry in shade. Warm iron on the front or reverse as needed.<br/><br/>A little care helps preserve colour, shape and detailing so the piece can stay in rotation for longer.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_86emMQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Additional Information",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Tabi products are designed to address the impact of fast fashion on our environment. Each Tabi product is long lasting and sturdy, made with natural, biodegradable materials. No fabric is wasted, all leftovers are used in products made for our upcycle collection.  <br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_aMyLaW": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & Returns",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>Our products are made to order and are shipped within 2 to 5 working days of receiving the order.<br/><br/>If your Tabi piece does not work for you, you can request an exchange or return within 5 days of delivery, no questions asked.<br/><br/>Please refer to Shipping, Exchanges & Returns policy for more details.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "share": {
          "type": "share",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "share_label": "Share"
          }
        }
